    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForEachItem",
        "jsCode": "const item = $input.item.json;\nconst resumeText = item.text || '';\nconst role = item.role;\nlet prompt = '';\n\nif (role === 'SWE') {\n  prompt = `You are a technical hiring manager evaluating a Software Engineer candidate.\nAnalyze the following resume and provide a structured evaluation.\n\nCandidate Name: ${item.name}\nYears of Experience: ${item.yearsOfExperience}\nTech Stack mentioned in application: ${item.techStack}\nGitHub: ${item.githubProfile}\n\nResume Text:\n${resumeText}\n\nEvaluate based on these SWE criteria:\n- Programming languages and frameworks\n- Project complexity and impact\n- Open source or GitHub activity\n- Problem solving background\n- Overall technical depth\n- System design experience\n\nScoring Guide (be generous, consider experience level):\n- A candidate with 0-2 years showing good projects = strong\n- A candidate with real client work = strong\n- A candidate still learning but showing initiative = average\n- Only mark weak if there are serious gaps or no relevant skills\n\nClassification Thresholds:\n- \"strong\" if score >= 60\n- \"average\" if score >= 35\n- \"weak\" if score < 35\n\nReturn ONLY a valid JSON object in this exact format, nothing else:\n{\n  \"score\": <number 0-100>,\n  \"classification\": \"<strong or average or weak>\",\n  \"summary\": \"<2-3 sentence summary>\",\n  \"strengths\": [\"<strength 1>\", \"<strength 2>\", \"<strength 3>\"],\n  \"concerns\": [\"<concern 1>\", \"<concern 2>\"],\n  \"interviewRecommended\": <true or false>\n}`;\n\n} else {\n  prompt = `You are a senior hiring manager evaluating a Business Development Manager candidate.\nAnalyze the following resume and provide a structured evaluation.\n\nCandidate Name: ${item.name}\nYears of Experience: ${item.yearsOfExperience}\nIndustry Background: ${item.industryBackground}\nLinkedIn: ${item.linkedinProfile}\n\nResume Text:\n${resumeText}\n\nEvaluate based on these BDM criteria:\n- Sales and revenue track record\n- Client relationship management\n- Market expansion experience\n- Communication and leadership skills\n- Industry network and background\n- Business acumen and strategy\n\nScoring Guide (be generous, consider experience level):\n- A candidate showing any client work or sales exposure = strong\n- A candidate with transferable skills from technical background = average\n- A candidate with communication and leadership potential = average\n- Only mark weak if there are zero business development relevant skills\n\nClassification Thresholds:\n- \"strong\" if score >= 60\n- \"average\" if score >= 35\n- \"weak\" if score < 35\n\nReturn ONLY a valid JSON object in this exact format, nothing else:\n{\n  \"score\": <number 0-100>,\n  \"classification\": \"<strong or average or weak>\",\n  \"summary\": \"<2-3 sentence summary>\",\n  \"strengths\": [\"<strength 1>\", \"<strength 2>\", \"<strength 3>\"],\n  \"concerns\": [\"<concern 1>\", \"<concern 2>\"],\n  \"interviewRecommended\": <true or false>\n}`;\n}\n\nreturn {\n  ...item,\n  aiPrompt: prompt,\n  requestBody: {\n    model: \"mistral-small-latest\",\n    messages: [\n      {\n        role: \"user\",\n        content: prompt\n      }\n    ],\n    temperature: 0.3\n  }\n};"
      },
